{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sea is HANGRY. You and your friends look \u2728delicious\u2728. Deck-out your boat with bigger and better weapons to fight off waves of angry sea creatures, and remind them to get back in the sea(*).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(*) yes, they're already in the sea.\u00a0 But deeper in the sea where they're less bite-y.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 10 minutes.\u00a0 &lt;*\u035c\ud808\udd4b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have coin, the shipyard has wares. Get ship-shape!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize files for weapons &amp; enemies &amp; upgrades. Share challenges you create with\u00a0community!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master of the Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose powerful abilities that turn the tide in your favour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/71716a4ab3da11975d0b75fd85f8b5b2.poster.avif?t=1761875870\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/71716a4ab3da11975d0b75fd85f8b5b2.webm?t=1761875870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/71716a4ab3da11975d0b75fd85f8b5b2.mp4?t=1761875870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Armoured Crabs!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position to shoot weak spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.poster.avif?t=1761875870\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.webm?t=1761875870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.mp4?t=1761875870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(19/03/25): The game currently has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local coop up to 4 players via Steam Remote Play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 enemy types, 1 mini-boss, and special variants of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 droppable items (via the oyster): health pack, xp vacuum, sea-mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 abilities. (Boop, Drop Anchor!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 upgradeable stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ persistent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 gamemode (with modifiers; amount, hp).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459080?t=1761875870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459080?t=1761875870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/a0ddf1afce6545bf2d4436d6885937bae233a4af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761875870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/a0ddf1afce6545bf2d4436d6885937bae233a4af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761875870","categ